:*{{Ti|Prayer of Exorcism}}
:*{{Ti|Moonlight Gemstone}}
:*{{Ti|Cobalt}} 10x
:*{{Ti|Dark Weapon Fragment}} 5x
:*{{Ti|Gaya|300 Gaya}}
:*{{Ti|Yang|20.000.000 Yang}}
</ul>


<!-- Other information -->
|Other = The crafting method has a 50% success. See also: [[Item Refinement]]
