*Up to 3 default bonuses are added, marked with a <span style="color:#3400FF">blue color</span>
*All default bonuses and values are randomized chosen by system
*Below you'll find a table with all possible bonuses as well as the min-max values
*When changing the 1-5 bonuses, it is possible to have the same bonus as default

